S563 recursive multi-sieve lower-bound ledger
==============================================================================
Benchmark frame
  Tao: global 1/(2k) + c log(k)/(k^2 (log log k)^2), unspecified c.
  Bedert: later Riesz-product global improvement of polynomial scale.
  This script: case/recursive certificates, often reaching 1/(k+1).
  denominator cutoff Q=220

